Dialogue: 1,0:20:42.35,0:20:43.39,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\an7}{\c&000000\3c&ffffff\4c&ffffff\blur4\bord5}你輕喚我名字的聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.35,0:20:43.39,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\an7}{\c&000000\3c&ffffff\4c&ffffff\blur4\bord5}名前を呼んだ声がした
