Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.39,0:20:46.31,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}{\an7}{\c&000000\3c&ffffff\4c&ffffff\blur4\bord5}名前を呼んだ声がした
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.31,0:20:47.39,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\an7}{\c&000000\3c&ffffff\4c&ffffff\blur4\bord5}無論回憶多少次都清晰
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.31,0:20:47.39,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\an7}{\c&000000\3c&ffffff\4c&ffffff\blur4\bord5}思い出せる何度だって
Dialogue: 1,0:20:47.39,0:20:50.44,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}{\an7}{\c&000000\3c&ffffff\4c&ffffff\blur4\bord5}無論回憶多少次都清晰
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.39,0:20:50.44,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}{\an7}{\c&000000\3c&ffffff\4c&ffffff\blur4\bord5}思い出せる何度だって
Dialogue: 1,0:20:50.44,0:20:51.40,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\an7}{\c&000000\3c&ffffff\4c&ffffff\blur4\bord5}你曾在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.44,0:20:51.40,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\an7}{\c&000000\3c&ffffff\4c&ffffff\blur4\bord5}You were right here
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.40,0:20:52.44,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}{\an7}{\c&000000\3c&ffffff\4c&ffffff\blur4\bord5}你曾在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.40,0:20:52.44,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}{\an7}{\c&000000\3c&ffffff\4c&ffffff\blur4\bord5}You were right here
Dialogue: 1,0:20:52.44,0:20:54.98,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}{\an7}{\c&000000\3c&ffffff\4c&ffffff\blur4\bord5}就在這裡 與我一起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.44,0:20:54.98,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}{\an7}{\c&000000\3c&ffffff\4c&ffffff\blur4\bord5}Right here with me
Dialogue: 1,0:20:54.98,0:20:55.40,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\an7}{\c&000000\3c&ffffff\4c&ffffff\blur4\bord5}是啊 從心臟到指尖
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.98,0:20:55.40,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\an7}{\c&000000\3c&ffffff\4c&ffffff\blur4\bord5}そう、心臓から指先まで
Dialogue: 1,0:20:55.40,0:20:57.90,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\an7}{\c&000000\3c&ffffff\4c&ffffff\blur4\bord5}是啊 從心臟到指尖
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.40,0:20:57.90,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\an7}{\c&000000\3c&ffffff\4c&ffffff\blur4\bord5}そう、心臓から指先まで
Dialogue: 1,0:20:57.90,0:21:02.78,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}{\an7}{\c&000000\3c&ffffff\4c&ffffff\blur4\bord5}是啊 從心臟到指尖
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.90,0:21:02.78,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}{\an7}{\c&000000\3c&ffffff\4c&ffffff\blur4\bord5}そう、心臓から指先まで
Dialogue: 1,0:21:02.78,0:21:06.66,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}{\an7}{\c&000000\3c&ffffff\4c&ffffff\blur4\bord5}都渴望和你在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.78,0:21:06.66,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}{\an7}{\c&000000\3c&ffffff\4c&ffffff\blur4\bord5}あなたに触れたい
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.66,0:21:10.33,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}{\an7}{\c&000000\3c&ffffff\4c&ffffff\blur4\bord5}想要守護你 想要在你身旁不離
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.66,0:21:10.33,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}{\an7}{\c&000000\3c&ffffff\4c&ffffff\blur4\bord5}守りたい 隣にいたい
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.33,0:21:14.38,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}{\an7}{\c&000000\3c&ffffff\4c&ffffff\blur4\bord5}「直到重逢那日」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.33,0:21:14.38,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}{\an7}{\c&000000\3c&ffffff\4c&ffffff\blur4\bord5}また会う日まで なんて
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.38,0:21:16.55,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\an7}{\c&000000\3c&ffffff\4c&ffffff\blur4\bord5}漫無目的的我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.38,0:21:16.55,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\an7}{\c&000000\3c&ffffff\4c&ffffff\blur4\bord5}行く宛もないけど
Dialogue: 1,0:21:16.55,0:21:18.38,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}{\an7}{\c&000000\3c&ffffff\4c&ffffff\blur4\bord5}漫無目的的我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.55,0:21:18.38,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}{\an7}{\c&000000\3c&ffffff\4c&ffffff\blur4\bord5}行く宛もないけど
Dialogue: 1,0:21:18.38,0:21:18.80,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\an7}{\c&000000\3c&ffffff\4c&ffffff\blur4\bord5}卻再次 沿著你的足跡尋覓
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.38,0:21:18.80,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\an7}{\c&000000\3c&ffffff\4c&ffffff\blur4\bord5}その足跡をまた たどっていた
